1
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,600
Ananya walks home alone. She turns on Guard Mode.

2
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:28,530
The watch learns her body for 5 seconds (sped up).

3
00:00:28,530 --> 00:00:31,800
Guarding: it senses touch 5 times a second.

4
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:38,400
A stranger grabs her wrist: the touch signal jumps to 16 %, and her body's static jumps too.

5
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:45,000
Held 2 s: the watch vibrates, asks for her PIN and turns the mic on. She can't answer.

6
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:50,600
No PIN: her GPS location and voice recording go to her contacts. 112 is called.

7
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:52,530
Guard Mode back on.

8
00:00:52,530 --> 00:00:56,800
A friend holds her hand: the PIN decides. She types 1234.

9
00:00:56,800 --> 00:00:59,070
Cancelled. The recording is deleted.

10
00:00:59,070 --> 00:01:02,670
Forced to cancel, she types her duress PIN: 9999.

11
00:01:02,670 --> 00:01:06,270
It shows "Cancelled", but Amma gets a silent alert.

12
00:01:06,270 --> 00:01:10,200
He rips the watch off: alert at once, no PIN.

13
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:12,130
Guard Mode back on.

14
00:01:12,130 --> 00:01:18,730
A shoulder grab: the wrist sensor can't feel it, but the static jump and her pulled arm can.

15
00:01:18,730 --> 00:01:21,330
PIN prompt. (She cancels to continue.)

16
00:01:21,330 --> 00:01:27,600
She struggles to get free: motion sensors detect it even with no touch. PIN prompt, mic on.

17
00:01:27,600 --> 00:01:31,530
Her own hand on the watch: no other body, ignored.

18
00:01:31,530 --> 00:01:35,130
Strap on a metal pole: not a person, ignored.

19
00:01:35,130 --> 00:01:39,980
A brush in a crowd, someone close: no pulling, no touch. Ignored.

20
00:01:39,980 --> 00:01:45,580
She runs for a bus: no alarm, but a touch now asks for the PIN.

21
00:01:45,580 --> 00:01:50,520
9 simulated hours of daily life: 0–1 unwanted prompts (touch sensor alone: 24–28).
